* gw  95-11-10 s(235700) 2nd correction editor scroll right for model 5
* jwo 97-08-05 p(164321) avoid NAT1305 with #PLINES
* jwo 97-11-13 p(167263) add active reports exit
* jvd 98-05-04 p(168326)  Increase display size to show lines > 10m
* jvd 98-09-10 p(164220)  NOM141ÖNAT23
