* fhi     2005-04-21 NOM3107  Support 7-byte job numbers
* fhi     2005-05-12 S264877  Control on/off does not work
* xsetggr 2005-10-26 p(270950) ISN Fields must be P10, not P8
* fhi     2007-04-25 FHI223   Report size limited to 10000 lines
* xsetggr 2007-05-04 NOM3201  Support 11 byte run numbers
* fhi 07-08-31 P297219  Find command not executed,only 'parameter miss.'
* fhi 07-08-31 NRT2763  Go to end of last block with 'BOT', 'TOP' simil.
* fhi 08-06-09 P302721  Called program does not exist.
* xsetggr 2008-05-05 p(304350) restow due to changes in RMSPL--L
* splingl 2009-05-13 p(307659) Variable not initialized
* xsetggr 2009-11-16 P303510   honoured CONTROL ON/CONTROL OFF for unix
* xsetggr 2009-12-04 P308338   layout does not work under unix
* XSETGGR 2010-01-15 P308338   DELETE TEST PRINT
* fhi     2010-02-01 P320584   NOM7205, reports corrupted
* xsetggr 2010-02-24 P322145   restore message line location
* raya     2012-11-29 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of nomex*
* raya     2013-05-09 NOMALL-1214 backout check cat date of nomex*
* raya    2013-09-08 NOMALL-1278 get report creation date for mails
* fhi     2013-09-24 NOMALL-932 Change NOMEX08L to NOMEXP08
* SU1     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* CF1     2015-07-08 NOMALL-1669 Set unique log types
* SU2     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* fhi     2016-02-08 NOMALL-1822 Fill MA-CURRENT-LOCATION field
* SU3     2016-07-29 NOMALL-1518 NOM3.5 deactivate opt.Compiler
* fhi     2017-03-30 NOMALL-1916 Do not use the SAG Physical Editor
* SU4     2017-09-26 NOMALL-1823 NOM 3.5: remove CONNECT
* BLI     2020-06-09 NOMALL-2418 NOM 3.5: remove CONNECT
* SU5     2021-05-31 NOMALL-2454 recat for EXIT-CB
